{"id":"f3b6daa28ddd9b5d","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-compactness.md","title":"Finitary Consequence","display":"df-compactness — Finitary Consequence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-compactness","aliases":["93-df-compactness"],"display":"df-compactness — Finitary Consequence","depends_on":["[[93-df-finite-subset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-compactness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-compactness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-compactness — Finitary Consequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6b63f2f43b5511ee\" href=\"?note=6b63f2f43b5511ee\" title=\"93-df-finite-subset\">93-df-finite-subset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> is a formula-set candidate and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\\subseteq\\mathcal P(F)\\times F\">\\(\\vdash\\subseteq\\mathcal P(F)\\times F\\)</span> is a consequence-relation candidate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\([\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> is the finite-subset family of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6b63f2f43b5511ee\" href=\"?note=6b63f2f43b5511ee\" title=\"93-df-finite-subset\">93-df-finite-subset</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Compact}_{93}\\)</span> is defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}compactness}\\vdash\\mathrm{Compact}_{93}(\\vdash;F)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\vdash\\;\\subseteq\\mathcal P(F)\\times F\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in F\\;\n\\Bigl(\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi\\to\\exists\\Gamma_0\\in[\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(\\Gamma_0\\vdash\\varphi)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}compactness}\\vdash\\mathrm{Compact}_{93}(\\vdash;F)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\vdash\\;\\subseteq\\mathcal P(F)\\times F\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in F\\;\n\\Bigl(\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi\\to\\exists\\Gamma_0\\in[\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(\\Gamma_0\\vdash\\varphi)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is syntactic compactness, equivalently finitarity of the consequence relation. The formula universe is an explicit parameter.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-finite-subset","status":"resolved","id":"6b63f2f43b5511ee","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-finite-subset]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-finite-subset","status":"resolved","id":"6b63f2f43b5511ee","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$[\\Gamma]^{<\\omega}$ is the finite-subset family of [[93-df-finite-subset]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash\\subseteq\\mathcal P(F)\\times F","display":false},{"tex":"[\\Gamma]^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Compact}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}compactness}\\vdash\\mathrm{Compact}_{93}(\\vdash;F)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\vdash\\;\\subseteq\\mathcal P(F)\\times F\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in F\\;\n\\Bigl(\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi\\to\\exists\\Gamma_0\\in[\\Gamma]^{<\\omega}\\;(\\Gamma_0\\vdash\\varphi)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":994,"backlinks":[{"id":"9e93b2477e743baa","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Compact}_{93}$ is the finitarity predicate of [[93-df-compactness]]."},{"id":"33b00fd0b4d5a311","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Compact}_{93}(\\vdash;F)$ is the compactness predicate of [[93-df-compactness]]."},{"id":"2ca0c3180b26a019","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["6b63f2f43b5511ee"]}